相似镜头。\n禁止场景变化或家具变化。\n禁止风格描述或审美限定词。\n\n第一行\n左上：主视觉建立镜头，轻广角构图，沙发为主体，占主要画面比例，结构清晰，空间关系完整。\n中上：完全不同方向的中景构图，改变拍摄角度与透视方向，展示沙发与环境关系。\n右上：另一方向的中景或半广角构图，强调空间延展性。\n\n第二行\n左中：局部材质特写，聚焦沙发细节，不包含完整空间。\n中中：空置使用状态展示构图，但不得出现人物或使用行为暗示。\n右中：侧向中景构图，强调沙发侧面结构与空间关系。\n\n第三行\n左下：低机位仰拍镜头，强调体量感与结构张力。\n中下：高机位俯拍镜头，展示整体空间布局关系。\n右下：极端视角创意构图，与其他画面完全不同。\n\n输出为一张完整3×3九宫格产品海报图，不包含任何文字说明。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 61, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_grid", "links": [231], "label": "image_grid", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_grid"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [6442.25634765625, 721.3785400390625], "widgets_values": [3, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 239, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "grid_rows"}, "name": "grid_rows", "label": "grid_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "grid_rows"}, {"widget": {"name": "grid_cols"}, "name": "grid_cols", "label": "grid_cols", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "grid_cols"}], "flags": {}, "id": 127, "type": "ImageGridSplitNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageGridSplitNode"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_grid", "links": [240], "label": "image_grid", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_grid"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [6422.33984375, 1116.8572998046875], "widgets_values": [3, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 241, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "grid_rows"}, "name": "grid_rows", "label": "grid_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "grid_rows"}, {"widget": {"name": "grid_cols"}, "name": "grid_cols", "label": "grid_cols", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "grid_cols"}], "flags": {}, "id": 128, "type": "ImageGridSplitNo